---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import wave from '../assets/gold_wave.jpg';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { QUESTIONARIO_URL } from '../config';
---
<section id="prezzo" class="on-paper relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-paper text-paper-ink" aria-labelledby="prezzo-t">
  <Image src={wave} alt="" widths={[800, 1600, 2400]} sizes="100vw" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-[min(70vw,40rem)] w-full object-cover object-center opacity-90" loading="lazy" />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgb(244_239_230/0.15)_0%,rgb(244_239_230/0.55)_30%,#f4efe6_62%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap pb-24 pt-20 sm:pb-32 sm:pt-28">
    <p class="t-kicker text-gold-deep">Prezzo e garanzie</p>
    <h2 id="prezzo-t" class="sr-only">Prezzo: sito di una pagina a 197 euro, con due garanzie</h2>
    <div class="mt-2 grid items-end gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] lg:gap-14">
      <p class="monument font-display font-medium leading-[0.8] tracking-[-0.075em]" aria-hidden="true">197<span class="ml-[0.04em] align-top text-[0.42em] tracking-[-0.02em]">€</span></p>
      <div class="pb-[1.2vw]">
        <p class="t-h3 !text-[clamp(1.4rem,1.1rem+1vw,2rem)]">Sito di una pagina · 197 €</p>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[26rem] text-paper-muted">Prezzo finale, nessuna IVA (regime forfettario). Dominio a parte, intestato a te.</p>
        <a href={QUESTIONARIO_URL} class="btn btn-ink mt-8">Richiedi il tuo sito <Icon name="arrow-right" /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] bg-paper/80 p-7 shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_rgb(122_91_30/0.35)] backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-9">
        <Icon name="shield-check" class="size-8 text-gold-deep" />
        <h3 class="t-h3 mt-6">Online in tempo, o rimborso.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-paper-muted">Se il sito non è online entro 7 giorni lavorativi da quando ho tutto il materiale, ti restituisco i 197 €.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[1.6rem] bg-paper/80 p-7 shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_rgb(122_91_30/0.35)] backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-9">
        <Icon name="rotate-ccw" class="size-8 text-gold-deep" />
        <h3 class="t-h3 mt-6">Soddisfatto o rimborsato.</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-paper-muted">Hai 7 giorni dalla messa online per chiedere il rimborso, per qualsiasi motivo. Senza domande.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .monument {
    font-size: clamp(9rem, 2rem + 34vw, 22rem);
    color: var(--color-paper-ink);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2216 0%, #1a1712 45%, #5a4317 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-left: -0.06em;
  }
</style>
